<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82885" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῆγμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πήγνυμι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>anything fastened</i> or
				<i>joined together, framework</i>, of a ship, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέλητος π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				5.203
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ π. τῆς σχεδίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.Byz.
					<u>Mir.</u>
					4.5
				</span></i>
			; of a roof, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Annuario</u>
				6
			</span></i>/<i><span class="en">
				7.450
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύρα κέλλας, στοὰ σὺν
			πήγμασι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				2146.9
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				12
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τῶν ὀστέων
			π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>4 Ma.</u>
				9.21
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ πιοειδὲς π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Heliod.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				49.33.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>stage</i> or <i>scaffold</i> used in theatres, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				6.2.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				14.15.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BJ</u>
				7.5.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Juv.
				4.122
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suet.
				<u>Claud.</u>
				34
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>bookcase</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Att.</u>
				4.8.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. γενναίως παγέν</span> (Aurat. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῆμα</span>) <i>bond</i> in honour
			bound, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1198
			</span></i> ; but also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τῆς ὅλης π. σοφίας</span>
			<i>fabric</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.536
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>anything congealed</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ π. τῆς
				χιόνος</span> frozen snow, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.55.5
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ π. τῆς τροφῆς</span>, i. e.
			fat, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Onom.</u>
				215
			</span></i> ; <i>solid mass</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔστη
			π</span>., of the waters of Jordan, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jo.</u>
				3.16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>that which makes to curdle</i>, as rennet does milk, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				516a4
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
